Package: fastcharge
Version: 1.3
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: mainline sm8850 build <root@localhost>
Depends: kmod, libc6 (>= 2.39)
Description: profile-driven USB PD fast-charge service for SM8850 (iceland)
 fastcharged watches the battery (SoC, temperature) and drives the
 charge_boost_lite kernel module (shipped by the kernel
 build, not this package) to request fixed
 USB-PD PDOs with a per-situation input current limit, following the
 profile in /etc/fastcharge/fastcharge.conf. Hard caps: 12 V / 3 A; the
 profile must cover the whole SoC x temperature domain or the daemon
 refuses to boost.
